#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-board.rst:14
#: 0de37d68020f442ab83fb4c4456da8fd
msgid "The Open Camera Control Board (OpenCCB) is a camera remote control interface for aerial photography. It has :ref:`many features <common-camera-control-board_port_mapping>`, including: FTDI USB/UART adapter, USB HOST, Digital IO, Analog IO, Optocoupled IO, etc."
msgstr ""

